From 29b098308291918752ef4f01319923e699cc6479 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Val Packett <val@packett.cool>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 00:27:31 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 100/136] drm/panel: Add driver for Novatek NT37701 based OLED
 panels

Add a driver for panels with the NT37701 DDIC, starting with the Tianma
panel (unknown model) used in the Motorola Edge 30 (dubai) smartphone.

Signed-off-by: Val Packett <val@packett.cool>
Signed-off-by: Marcus Ramberg <marcus@means.no>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Makefile                |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt37701.c | 676 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 677 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt37701.c

